Building: Simplified 15-storey office building
Thermal zones: Bottom (1x), Typical (13x), Top (1x)
Location: Singapore
Weather: Singapore Changi EPW
HVAC: VAV air-cooled chiller with PFP boxes
Building vintage: ASHRAE 90.1 2019 / IECC 2021

Variable facade parameters:
- Glazing product (U-value and SHGC)
- Window-to-wall ratio (WWR)
- Shading depth

Fixed assumptions:
- Building geometry and orientation
- Occupancy and internal loads
- HVAC system and schedules
- Weather and simulation settings

Glazing VLT: Fixed/default assumption; verify and document actual value.
Model purpose: Generate a consistent 160-case EnergyPlus dataset for FacadeAI.</item>
