                    <item name="UserText" type_name="gh_string" type_code="10">FACADEAI — BATCH EXPORT CONTROLLER

Purpose: Sequentially export 160 Honeybee models from the input CSV.

Inputs:
- start: batch export trigger
- csv_path: 160-case input CSV
- simulation_folder: simulation output root

Outputs:
- index: selected case index (0–159)
- write_osm: Honeybee export control
- run_model: ModelToOSM control
- status: export progress

IMPORTANT:
Current runner is a prototype and requires reliable export-completion synchronization before unattended execution.

OpenStudio/EnergyPlus simulation and result extraction should be handled by a separate Python batch runner.

Keep start=False until the batch automation is finalized.</item>
